@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About</PageTitle>

<h1>About</h1>

<p><strong>Keepmark</strong> v@(AppInfo.VersionString) (build @(AppInfo.BuildString))</p>
<p>An independent, private bookmark sync client. Not affiliated with xBrowserSync.</p>

<h3>Compatibility</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Works with any <strong>xBrowserSync API v@Core.XbsConstants.ApiVersion</strong> service
        (official, self-hosted or community), API v@(Core.XbsConstants.MinApiVersion)+ required.
        When the service advertises it, the <strong>v@(Core.XbsConstants.ApiVersion12) extended contract</strong>
        is used (revision-based sync, conditional download, server delete) with automatic fallback to v1.1.</li>
    <li>Sync format <strong>v@(Core.XbsConstants.SyncClientVersion)</strong>: syncs created here
        open in the official xBrowserSync apps, and vice versa.</li>
    <li>Same end-to-end encryption (PBKDF2-SHA256 + AES-GCM): only your password
        unlocks the data — the service operator cannot read it.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Project</h3>
<p>Source code, releases, issue tracker and documentation:
    <a href="https://github.com/Keepmark">github.com/Keepmark</a></p>

